# Helm Conventions

- Use `_helpers.tpl` for reusable template logic (labels, names, selectors)
- All values have sensible defaults for dev/local testing
- No hardcoded namespaces — use `{{ .Release.Namespace }}`
- No hardcoded cluster domains — use `CHANGE_ME` or derive via values
- 2-space YAML indentation
- Gate optional resources with `{{- if .Values.<feature>.enabled }}`
- Comments for non-obvious values in `values.yaml`
- Use `{{ .Values.global.clusterDomain }}` for cross-chart domain references

## Validate before committing

```bash
helm template charts/<chart-name>
helm lint charts/<chart-name>
```
